---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="申請時程｜TBD Studio" description="大學個人申請、研究所推甄、特殊選才準備時程一覽：各申請階段截止日與關鍵任務，以及 TBD Studio 建議的最佳切入時機。" bodyClass="sub-page">
<section class="hero">
  <span class="kicker">申請時程</span>
  <h1>越早開始，越能把經歷整理成有策略的申請材料。</h1>
  <p class="lead">如果等到放榜後才開始準備備審，通常只能救急；如果提前 1–3 個月開始，內容會更完整，也更容易做出校系差異化。</p>
</section>

<main>
  <section class="section">
    <h2>大學個人申請</h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">高二下～高三上</div><div><h3>累積與盤點期</h3><p>學習歷程整理、科系探索、多元表現盤點。</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">高三 1 月</div><div><h3>學測前後</h3><p>申請方向初判、落點預估。</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">高三 2 月</div><div><h3>學測成績公布</h3><p>選校策略、申請校系確認。</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">高三 3 月</div><div><h3>一階篩選</h3><p>針對通過校系客製備審。</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">高三 4 月</div><div><h3>備審上傳期</h3><p>自傳、申請動機、讀書計畫、學習歷程自述。</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">高三 5 月</div><div><h3>二階面試</h3><p>模擬面試、教授追問、臨場表達。</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">高三 6 月</div><div><h3>志願序與放榜</h3><p>志願排序、備取判斷。</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>研究所推甄</h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">大三下～暑假</div><div><h3>前置準備</h3><p>履歷、自傳、研究方向、教授名單。</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">7～8 月</div><div><h3>材料初稿</h3><p>研究計畫、讀書計畫、專題整理。</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">9～10 月</div><div><h3>報名期</h3><p>書審資料定稿、教授聯絡。</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">10～11 月</div><div><h3>面試期</h3><p>模擬面試、研究計畫答辯。</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">11～12 月</div><div><h3>放榜期</h3><p>備取策略、後續聯繫。</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>特殊選才</h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">高二～高三上</div><div><h3>經歷累積</h3><p>競賽、專題、作品、證明資料。</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">9～10 月</div><div><h3>簡章公告</h3><p>校系篩選、資格確認。</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">10～11 月</div><div><h3>書審報名</h3><p>自傳、成果集、申請動機。</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">11～12 月</div><div><h3>面試／甄試</h3><p>作品答辯、特殊經歷說明。</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-time">12～1 月</div><div><h3>放榜</h3><p>後續升學規劃。</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta">
    <h2>不確定現在應該做什麼？</h2>
    <p>TBD 的第一次策略諮詢會依據你的年級、升學管道與目前進度，說明哪些事情現在就該開始，哪些可以等。</p>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button secondary" href="/pages/services.html">了解服務內容</a>
      <a class="button" href="https://lin.ee/9ciZvbA?utm_source=website&utm_medium=cta&utm_campaign=timeline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">預約策略諮詢</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
